      "file": "signer/server.ts",
      "line": 109,
      "evidence": "const server = createServer((req, res) => void handle(req, res).catch((error) => send(res, 500, { reason: \"signer.error\", message: (error as Error).message })))",
      "platform": "FeltKit serves every function over HTTP with authorization (app.query/mutation/action)",
      "acknowledged": "The approval signer must not run as this application's functions or component: it holds the signing key and must stay outside the trust boundary of the application it checks. A stateless HTTP endpoint (POST /sign) in its own process is the smallest form. See docs/AUTHORIZATION-INTEGRATION.md."
    }
